<instruction name="VCVTPS2PH">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Convert Single Precision FP Value to 16-bit FP Value</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1046015">
   <string>Convert packed single precision floating values in the source operand to half-precision (16-bit) floating-point values and store to the destination operand. The rounding mode is specified using the immediate field (imm8).</string></para>
  <para unique="1046016">
   <string>Underflow results (i.e., tiny results) are converted to denormals. MXCSR.FTZ is ignored. If a source element is denormal relative to the input format with DM masked and at least one of PM or UM unmasked; a SIMD exception will be raised with DE, UE and PE set.</string></para>
