  <para unique="1046026">
   <string>The immediate byte defines several bit fields that control rounding operation. The effect and encoding of the RC field are listed in </string><link linkend="68937: 06_Table: Table 5-3. Immediate Byte Encoding for 16-bit Floating-Point"><string>Table 5&#8209;3</string></link><string>.</string></para>
